License: MIT
Source: https://github.com/bigfish1913/pi-rust
Merged at rpi 0.14.0, commit.id 534bcbffb7e1e7551d9ee3572dfeb278e203e493.

The Agent runtime under crates/pi-star-ai, pi-star-agent, pi-star-tools and
pi-star-harness is a source copy of the corresponding rpi crates, renamed and
modified for pi-star. It is maintained in this repository; see
docs/upstream-rpi.md for the mapping and the local changes.

pi-star also reads files produced by the pi coding agent. pi itself is not
bundled with pi-star.
